{
    "name": "建筑材料",
    "category": "tfg:craftsmanship",
    "icon": "tfc:wattle/white",
    "pages": [
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#primitive_materials)原始材料$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#thatch)茅草$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#mud_bricks)泥砖$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#wattle_and_daub)板条与涂料$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#advanced_materials)进阶材料$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#alabaster)雪花石膏$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#bricks_and_mortar)砖块与砂浆$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#block_interactions)方块互动$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#roof_building)屋顶建造$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#modern)现代材料$()",
            "title": "目录",
            "anchor": "index"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "primitive_materials",
            "title": "原始材料",
            "text": "在游戏前期，建造可能是个挑战，因为许多坚固的建材都需要金属工具才能获取。不过仍有几种建材只用石器就能得到。$(br2)有了金属工具，就能获取更多 $(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#advanced_materials)进阶建材$()。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "thatch",
            "text": "只需一把 $(l:craftsmanship/sticks_and_stones)石刀$()，你就能通过破坏植物类方块获得 $(thing)干草$()。它可以用来合成一种非常简单的建材：$(thing)茅草$()。茅草是一种不受重力影响的轻质方块，但玩家和其他实体可以直接穿过它！需要的话，它也可以重新合成为 $(thing)干草$()。",
            "title": "茅草"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "anchor": "mud_bricks",
            "recipe": "tfc:crafting/soil/loam_drying_bricks",
            "title": "泥砖",
            "text": "$(thing)泥$()可以在地面上、一些水体下方、低海拔的沼泽环境中找到，也可以用 $(item)$(k:key.drop)$()把泥土丢进水里直接制作。加一点 $(thing)干草$()，就能把它合成 $()湿泥砖$()。"
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:multimultiblock",
            "text": "它们可以放在干燥的地方，一天后它们会硬化成$(thing)壤泥砖$()。",
            "multiblocks": [
                {
                    "pattern": [
                        [
                            "X"
                        ],
                        [
                            "Y"
                        ],
                        [
                            "0"
                        ]
                    ],
                    "mapping": {
                        "X": "tfc:drying_bricks/loam[count=4,dried=false]",
                        "Y": "tfc:grass/loam"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "pattern": [
                        [
                            "X"
                        ],
                        [
                            "Y"
                        ],
                        [
                            "0"
                        ]
                    ],
                    "mapping": {
                        "X": "tfc:drying_bricks/loam[count=4,dried=true]",
                        "Y": "tfc:grass/loam"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "recipe": "tfc:crafting/soil/loam_mud_bricks",
            "title": "泥砖块",
            "text": "这些晾干的泥砖可以进一步合成 $(thing)泥砖块$()。如有需要，还能做成 $(thing)楼梯$()、$(thing)台阶$()或 $(thing)墙$()。泥砖块可以用锹挖掘。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "wattle_and_daub",
            "text": "$(thing)板条$()和 $(thing)涂料$()是一种用途广泛的结构和装饰方块。$(br)$(thing)板条$()可以合成并放置，但它可以被破坏，玩家和生物也能直接穿过。用 $(thing)涂料$()加固它，就能让它变得坚实。$(br)要让 $(thing)板条$()变得坚实，首先要进行编织，也就是往结构上添加木棍。",
            "title": "板条与涂料"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "images": [
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/wattle_weave.png"
            ],
            "text": "手持至少四根木棍来$(thing)编织$()板条。",
            "border": true
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "可以在板条方块的顶面、底面、和两条对角线添加额外的木棍来添加装饰花纹。手持$(thing)木棍$()并对着板条方块按$(item)$(k:key.use)$()就可以添加一根木棍了。要装饰不同的部位，只需瞄准板条不同的面即可。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "images": [
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/wattle_add_stick.png"
            ],
            "text": "在板条上添加木棍。",
            "border": true
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "images": [
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/wattle_add_daub.png"
            ],
            "text": "对准$(thing)编织加固过的板条$()使用$(thing)涂料$()就能将其转变为实心方块。",
            "border": true
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "images": [
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/wattle_stained.png"
            ],
            "text": "之后可以对它使用 $(thing)染料$()来进行 $(thing)染色$()。",
            "border": true
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:multimultiblock",
            "text": "板条与涂料的施工过程。",
            "multiblocks": [
                {
                    "pattern": [
                        [
